world  revised gravity chain with bearing guides

-- Complete candidate revision; not yet verified by a successful run.
-- MuJoCo's default gravity is 9.81 m/s².
-- Every moving body starts from rest.
-- No launches, starting spins, or powered actuators are used.
--
-- Language limitations:
-- bounce dead does not specify numeric restitution 0.05.
-- Physical bearing guides replace unavailable slide joints.
-- Linear slide damping 0.20 N·s/m cannot be prescribed.
--
-- Each ramp deck is 1.00 m long, 0.30 m wide, and inclined at 20°.
-- Deck centre-line endpoints account for its 4 cm thickness.
-- Each low upper surface is 0.15 m above the floor.

